(text "65-key compact laptop-style layout, Cherry MX Ultra Low Profile tactile switches, one diode per key." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ed693766-8c44-5d8f-8e7d-7997a6c5999f))
(text "RGB revision: same 273.5 x 80.0 mm outline, key positions and active matrix contacts." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 237fc7b2-f184-502b-b07d-7a61b5e9b7b3))
(text "This sheet is the keyboard PCB itself: switches, matrix diodes, EC FFC, and bring-up notes." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 84bf5ad6-2ceb-55df-8d0b-38ae366e884c))
