(global_label "GND"
  (shape bidirectional)
  (at 420.37 459.74 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  (uuid c142023a-6549-5c8f-b7a4-2a5272be0dd9)
)
(text "NOTES:" (at 20.32 482.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f4f8c2bc-f4b4-5566-9266-3fc25002a025))
(text "Use CHERRY MX6C-T3NB tactile switches. The five MP fixation lands connect to GND per CHERRY PCB-reference-design; pins 1/2 form the matrix." (at 20.32 490.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 32c392fa-1459-5317-a5a4-c33c94125c6a))
(text "D320-D384 are JSCJ 1N4148WS, SOD-323, C2128. Pin 2 is anode on KB_ROWn; pin 1 is cathode at the per-key switch node." (at 20.32 497.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f84d8c2e-c0fb-50c6-bb5e-06a77272b970))
(text "J320 mirrors mainboard J310. Fit mainboard R387 for the RGB I2C buffer; keep R386 absent so the 5 V current limit cannot be bypassed." (at 20.32 505.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 8064b4ff-22ad-5a37-90da-5c2d5edd47ec))
(text "Fit LEDs and support parts before the MX ULP switches. Follow CHERRY's assembly process and check a first article." (at 20.32 513.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid bf65d5c9-8b1a-55ec-951f-3b2a6c6e9b3d))
(text "The split space layout is unchanged. Check the large keycaps and stabilizers with the actual switch/plate stack." (at 20.32 520.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a0a60c11-b1ab-588e-ab1e-3874755aae77))
(text "Legends/keycaps are mechanical deliverables: prototype blank resin/MJF caps and clip coupons before final legends or stabilizer bars." (at 20.32 528.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid aa5585c8-9180-501c-9241-0a225fdfd27a))
(text "keyboard rgb: 65 separate colours, hardware-limited current" (at 650.24 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 96e9fa88-e9e1-51fe-b7bf-592d95aa17c8))
(text "Everlight 19-337/R6GHBHC-C02/2T, 1.6 x 1.6 x 0.35 mm; LEDs are fitted before the switches." (at 650.24 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 41a4f79e-000f-5994-9573-63f79fb14682))
(text "Physical rows use sink groups 1..5; the ten extra keys use group 6. Scan banks follow nearby columns." (at 650.24 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 06812cf7-d2a8-51b7-a952-0d7edd7c1f0f))
