(text "J320 pin 29 is the switched 5 V rail. Pin 2 needs mainboard R387 fitted for the I2C buffer." (at 650.24 709.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d4340473-d02a-5eff-ac0a-ea67d169a286))
(text "U321 A side is the main 3.3 V bus; B side is the switched 5 V RGB bus. Its power-off isolation keeps the unpowered LED driver off the EC bus." (at 650.24 720.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 61f556d3-0926-5c2a-b226-eeb1e1ea8f31))
(text "ADDR1/ADDR2 at VCC select 7-bit address 0x2F. SDB rises through R323/C326; wait 20 ms before setup." (at 650.24 730.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid de912bd5-5b98-50ff-826c-d65780b0e359))
(text "R320 limits peak sink current to about 11.3 mA at the datasheet corner: 18 active sinks stay below the cable budget." (at 650.24 740.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 8abf020b-1e07-5d48-948f-8020087100d6))
(text "Keep C322/C323 close to VCC, C324/C325 close to PVCC, and R320 close to ISET. Connect the exposed pad to ground." (at 650.24 750.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 64c7fafc-be6f-58f1-99fc-834e04dce2ea))
